result: Implemented `compact StoreName` statement + `@compact(threshold)` auto-policy
  decorator for tombstone reclamation. Runtime jinn_store_compact/jinn_store_compact_if
  in migrate.c rewrite the .store file dropping soft-deleted rows while preserving
  the schema fingerprint/version; auto-policy triggers after a delete once tombstones
  reach the threshold. Full pipeline (AST/HIR/parser/typer/MIR/codegen) wired. 5 conformance
  tests in tests/store_compact.rs pass; full suite (32 suites) green, zero warnings.
description: Item 6. Add 'compact StoreName' statement (and optional @compact(threshold)
  decorator) rewriting the record file dropping tombstones older than any live @versioned
  reference, then checkpoint + truncate WAL.
